<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal inflation 1.8 pct yr/yr April.</title>
<headline>Portugal inflation 1.8 pct yr/yr April.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese consumer prices rose 0.2 percent in April after 0.1 percent in March to give year-on-year inflation of 1.8 percent after 2.5 percent previously, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>Average annual inflation, the government's yardstick, was 3.1 percent in April after 3.2 percent in March.  </p>
<p> PORTUGUESE INFLATION	  Apr 97	 Mar 97     Apr 96</p>
<p> Monthly CPI rise		  0.2	    0.1	  0.9</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr inflation		1.8	    2.5	  2.0</p>
<p> Average annual inflation	3.1	    3.2	  3.4</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	 133.3	  133.0	130.9</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom 3511-3538254</p>
</text>
